# Story game scene masters: raw, full-size source photos for authoring, not
# deploy artifacts. The finished scene images go to the R2 bucket behind
# gamemedia.speaknigeria.org under a story/ prefix (see
# tools/segmenter/README.md), so git is not their home - dev/story-media/
# is where they're worked on locally. The small test-story fixtures ARE
# tracked, so a fresh clone can run the story game without any setup.
dev/story-media/story-1/
